To pay the EE bill, you can use the `pay_bill` tool. Here’s how you can call it:

```json
{
  "name": "pay_bill",
  "arguments": {
    "biller": "EE",
    "amount": 1800,
    "from_account": "CUR-6267",
    "pay_date": "2026-11-01"
  }
}
```

This will pay the EE bill of £1800 from your Everyday Current Account on November 1, 2026.

